			<div class="content" id="post-content-4852854">
									

<p>Check the scarlet-king tag. Note, however, that the lack of canon applies much more to Big Red than to standardized, fleshed-out things like Sarkicism and the CotBG, so you’re going to run into some contradictions.</p>
<p>One of the most compelling elements of the Scarlet King mythos is the mystery. Unlike most other anomalous religions, most of the cultists are wiped out and the Foundation is left trying to piece things together from the artifacts they left behind. Toss in the subterfuge going on with 2317 and 231’s implications that the Foundation’s been infiltrated or something, and you have a situation where the people in-universe are probably just as confused about it as the reader.</p>

